{"_id":"69a45f97132af09d9ab7de25","title":"Auto Answer No Key","game":{"_id":"699f41a082702cd6518d643f","gameId":130342654546662,"name":"[LEVEL!] Sambung Kata 💬","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b412c84a24b7561ab729114886a8513157ca09d74c993eb0043ce551fb54636a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8ee90666fb3f05df793140aa435d7b71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"130342654546662-sambung-kata","path":"/game/130342654546662-sambung-kata","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b412c84a24b7561ab729114886a8513157ca09d74c993eb0043ce551fb54636a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8ee90666fb3f05df793140aa435d7b71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":130342654546662},"slug":"Sambung-Kata-Auto-Answer-No-Key-126550","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":12908,"executes":5626,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b6fd1efd1069c88a3f34782af5d373001f552bf41ca0eb0afc0da4820cbc3c05.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/130342654546662-1772380055663.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/130342654546662-1772380055663.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b6fd1efd1069c88a3f34782af5d373001f552bf41ca0eb0afc0da4820cbc3c05.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/130342654546662-1772380055663.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/130342654546662-1772380055663.png"},"likeCount":8,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2026-03-01T15:47:35.711Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-01T15:47:35.711Z","lastBump":"2026-03-01T15:47:35.711Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pearanoids/Sambung-Kata-Roblox/refs/heads/main/SBX_Script.lua\"))()","features":"🎮 SAMBUNG KATA SCRIPT — AUTO ANSWER + GUI\n\nScript paling lengkap untuk game Sambung Kata di Roblox!\n\nDilengkapi database kosakata Bahasa Indonesia terbesar dengan ribuan kata\ndari A sampai Z, script ini akan otomatis menjawab sebelum pemain lain sempat mengetik!\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✨ FITUR UTAMA\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🤖 Auto Answer / Auto Jawab\n→ Secara otomatis mendeteksi huruf yang diminta\n→ Langsung mencari kata yang sesuai dari database\n→ Menjawab lebih cepat dari pemain manapun!\n\n🖥️ GUI (Graphical User Interface)\n→ Tampilan antarmuka yang bersih dan mudah digunakan\n→ Toggle ON/OFF dengan satu klik\n→ Tidak mengganggu tampilan game\n\n📚 Database Kosakata Terlengkap\n→ Ribuan kata Bahasa Indonesia dari A hingga Z\n→ Mencakup kata dasar, kata turunan, dan frasa umum\n→ Terus diperbarui secara berkala\n\n⚡ Performa Cepat & Stabil\n→ Ringan, tidak menyebabkan lag\n→ Stabil digunakan dalam sesi panjang\n→ Kompatibel dengan executor populer\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎯 CARA PAKAI\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1. Buka game Sambung Kata di Roblox\n2. Inject executor kamu (Delta, Arceus X, dll)\n3. Copy-paste script di bawah\n4. Execute / Jalankan\n5. GUI akan muncul → klik ON → Selamat bermain!\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n✅ KOMPATIBILITAS EXECUTOR\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n✔ Delta\n✔ Arceus X\n✔ Fluxus\n✔ Hydrogen\n✔ Dan executor lainnya yang support loadstring\n❌️ Xeno (masih dalam tahap pengembangan)\n\n\n🆓 GRATIS 100% — Tidak ada Key!\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️ DISCLAIMER\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nScript ini dibuat untuk tujuan hiburan dan edukasi.\n\nGunakan dengan bijak dan tanggung jawab.\n\nDeveloper tidak bertanggung jawab atas penyalahgunaan Script ini.","tags":["sambung kata","auto answer","free","no key","indonesia"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6946abf949abd0da14742324","username":"pearanoids","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/658f9eed180fb9709518897d3a55b3d86789663a35fee6a928ecf9caaa0061f5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6946abf949abd0da14742324-1772371031824.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6946abf949abd0da14742324","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","